<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Settings screen: categories, preference rows, dialogs.

     The rows are single-line, so a row carries a label and — where it has one — its
     current value, and nothing else. The explanatory sentences the rows used to carry
     are gone; the six free-text settings keep theirs inside the edit dialog, where a
     sentence has room, and the proxy-auth opt-out keeps its consequence in a notice. -->
